            <ArticleTitle>Every call is an opportunity. Supporting breastfeeding mothers over the telephone.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>525-32</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Breastfeeding generates numerous questions. Every call about breastfeeding received over the telephone is an opportunity for health care professionals to listen and support the caller and offer factual information and advice to help the family to have an enjoyable breastfeeding experience.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
